  "notable_quotes": [
    "Cooling mode changed crystallization rate: ambient cooling for 2 was faster than programmed cooling for 1, and this was proposed to determine which polymer formed.",
    "Both isomers are 3D layer-pillared nets with 1D channels along c, but their pore shapes differ: square channels in 1 versus honeycomb-like channels in 2.",
    "Extensive amine groups form H-bonds to bdc oxygens, generating 16-membered H-bonded squares in 1 and 12-membered H-bonded hexagons in 2."
